@startuml forms-vol11-flow-uz
title Jarayon namunasi - avj olishni tekshirish (11-jild)
autonumber

participant "Shifokor\n(2-jild)" as DR
participant "SES markazi\n(11-jild)" as SES
participant "Mikrobiologiya\nlaboratoriyasi (11-jild)" as LAB

DR -> SES : 058 shoshilinch bildirishnoma (3-jild)\n060 yuqumli kasalliklar jurnali, 264 shoshilinch bildirishnoma
SES -> SES : 262 epidemiologik o'choqni tekshirish kartasi
SES -> LAB : bemorlar va atrof-muhitdan namunalar
LAB -> SES : 350/365-378 mikrobiologik tekshiruv natijalari
alt o'choq tasdiqlangan
  SES -> SES : 258/259 bemorlarni tashish/evakuatsiya qilish\n261 o'choqda dezinfeksiya, 390 yakuniy dezinfeksiya buyrug'i
end
alt sanitariya qoidabuzarligi aniqlangan
  SES -> SES : 311 qoidabuzarlik bayonnomasi, 312 jarima
end

note over SES, LAB
  Shoshilinch bildirishnoma shakli (058) 3-jildga kiritilgan;
  laboratoriyalar 3-jilddagi tahlil shakllari andozasiga amal qiladi.
  Jurnallarning o'zi klinik hujjat emas, balki ma'lumotlar bo'yicha so'rovlardir.
end note
@enduml
